{"id":145718621,"slug":"what-went-wrong-mdma-on-the-carlat","title":"What Went Wrong? MDMA-AT on the Carlat Psychiatry Podcast","subtitle":"The field of psychiatry wasn't engaged by MAPS, and should have been","post_date":"2024-06-19T11:46:02.343Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/what-went-wrong-mdma-on-the-carlat","wordcount":377,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:52:38.843Z","body_sha256":"dc15b35e75e9180e17af24c33dfbe45df923acb0b0d6197e8a28b4fae7e89065","text_words":378,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>The Frontier Psychiatrists is a daily-enough health-themed newsletter…that tries to have a laugh while exploring serious topics.</p><p>Every once in a while, Owen Muir, M.D., also gets to crank out serious academic work.   Much of that has been on topics of neuromodulation, Ai diagnostics, and psychedelic medicine. For new readers, there is a bar at the top of the website version that lets you visit my Google Scholar publications.  Or <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=se6A8r0AAAAJ&amp;hl=en\">just click here.</a></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z89d!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe885be51-755c-4971-805e-26078774899f_4284x5712.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z89d!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe885be51-755c-4971-805e-26078774899f_4284x5712.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z89d!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe885be51-755c-4971-805e-2